# Portfolio Goals

The portfolio should communicate:

1. What was built
2. Why it was built
3. What was learned
4. What technologies were used
5. How the system works
6. What engineering problems were solved
7. What could be improved
8. What the developer is currently learning

The portfolio should prioritize **honest technical presentation over exaggerated claims**.

Avoid presenting learning projects as production systems unless they are actually used in production.

